00:07:11.622 --> 00:07:12.622
LESTER LITCHFIELD: Sure.

00:07:12.622 --> 00:07:16.190
So Google Analytics is our
web analytics platform.

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:18.175
We use it for heaps of things.

00:07:18.175 --> 00:07:22.953
One, to understand where people
come from to get to the site.

00:07:22.953 --> 00:07:25.710
Number two, what
