of pages they're using,

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:31.340
what parts of the
products they find useful,

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:34.960
what sort of interactions lead
on to kind of goal completions

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:38.000
or things we want people to do.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:43.250
We also use it to measure and
attribute our marketing spend,

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:46.750
and we use it to test things
like conversion funnels,

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:48.610
how people move
