00:07:51.442 --> 00:07:53.400
and the outcomes that
different kinds of people

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.244
are contributing
to the business.

00:07:55.244 --> 00:07:57.160
So we use it across all
of our sites and apps.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:00.860
So that's a desktop website,
a mobile site, and about five

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:03.440
